{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"751bcc7f-2ae0-492d-acb4-3262e50ac930","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now grep-guard.sh.\n\nNeed to be careful with the A14 check and the \"present\" logic.\n\nImplementation:\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# header...\nset -euo pipefail\n\nROOT=...\nVIOLATIONS=0\n\nviolation() { echo \"违例：$*\"; VIOLATIONS=$((VIOLATIONS+1)); }\n\npresent=0\nfor d in windows admin android server; do [ -d \"$ROOT/$d\" ] && present=1; done\nif [ \"$present\" -eq 0 ]; then\n  echo \"待测：模块未交付（windows/ admin/ android/ server/ 均不存在）\"\n  exit 0\nfi\n\nis_source_file() {\n  case \"${1##*.}\" in\n    cs|csproj|xaml|py|java|kt|kts|js|jsx|ts|tsx|c|h|cc|cpp|hpp|rs|go|rb|php|swift|m|mm|sh|bash|groovy|gradle) return 0 ;;\n    *) return 1 ;;\n  esac\n}\n\ncheck_lang() { # $1=目录 $2=允许的源码扩展名（|ext|ext|） $3=端名\n  local dir=\"$1\" allowed=\"$2\" label=\"$3\" f ext\n  if [ ! -d \"$dir\" ]; then\n    echo \"待测：模块未交付（$label 目录不存在）\"\n    return\n  fi\n  if [ -z \"$(find \"$dir\" -type f -print -quit)\" ]; then\n    echo \"待测：模块未交付（$label 目录为空）\"\n    return\n  fi\n  while IFS= read -r f; do\n    is_source_file \"$f\" || continue\n    ext=\"${f##*.}\"\n    case \"$allowed\" in\n      *\"|$ext|\"*) ;;\n      *) violation \"${f#\"$ROOT\"/}（$label 只允许 ${allowed//|/ }，实际 .$ext）\" ;;\n    esac\n  done < <(find \"$dir\" -type f | sort)\n}\n```\n\nThe `${allowed//|/ }` produces spaces-ish. Fine.\n\nCall:\n```bash\ncheck_lang \"$ROOT/windows\" \"|cs|csproj|xaml|\" \"Windows\"\ncheck_lang \"$ROOT/admin\" \"|cs|csproj|xaml|\" \"管理端\"\ncheck_lang \"$ROOT/android\" \"|kt|kts|\" \"Android\"\ncheck_lang \"$ROOT/server\" \"|py|\" \"后台\"\n```\n\nA14 docs check:\n```bash\nARCH=\"$ROOT/docs/architecture.md\"\nif [ -f \"$ARCH\" ]; then\n  section=$(awk '/^## 技术栈/{flag=1;next}/^## /{flag=0}flag' \"$ARCH\")\n  for word in \".NET\" \"Kotlin\" \"Python\"; do\n    printf '%s' \"$section\" | grep -Fq \"$word\" || violation